.TH maw-src 1  "maw-src " 
.SH NAME
maw\-src \- packages built from your own xbps\-src templates in srcpkgs/
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmaw src\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
packages built from your own xbps\-src templates in srcpkgs/
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
maw\-src\-new(1)
write a srcpkgs/<name>/template, blank or drafted from nixpkgs or the aur, and open it
.TP
maw\-src\-update(1)
move a drafted template to its upstream\*(Aqs current version, then rebuild
.TP
maw\-src\-build(1)
build a template with xbps\-src; an installed package is upgraded to the new build
.SH EXTRA
see: maw help source packages
